{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S5EneZDvJfMpCn68GVr2Pe","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Authorized combined continuation\n2\tFor the independent controlled histories in jobs/, write a concise continuation report to outputs/continuation.md. For the separate actual interrupted increment-once effect recorded in retained/attempt.json, reconcile the original request with fresh target and public evidence, finish only outstanding work, and write outputs/recovery.md. Keep exact deciding references and unresolved obligations; do not restate the methodology at length. Conditional counter retry is allowed only if justified under the existing one-effect intent. Preserve all other files and the sentinel. Root selected a real fixed local primer that performs one admitted native counter publication before withholding its acknowledgment; it is not a model or historical review.\n3\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7ce3ab68-469f-4abe-8b90-21fe88ec11dc","uuid":"db1d9373-b3e8-4fc3-baf3-ea4b61bb0c5b","timestamp":"2026-10-25T03:33:26.552Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/stdo-skills-claude-recovery-95upc9_0/workspace/TASK.md","content":"# Authorized combined continuation\nFor the independent controlled histories in jobs/, write a concise continuation report to outputs/continuation.md. For the separate actual interrupted increment-once effect recorded in retained/attempt.json, reconcile the original request with fresh target and public evidence, finish only outstanding work, and write outputs/recovery.md. Keep exact deciding references and unresolved obligations; do not restate the methodology at length. Conditional counter retry is allowed only if justified under the existing one-effect intent. Preserve all other files and the sentinel. Root selected a real fixed local primer that performs one admitted native counter publication before withholding its acknowledgment; it is not a model or historical review.\n","numLines":3,"startLine":1,"totalLines":3}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01S5EneZDvJfMpCn68GVr2Pe","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
