{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013BRH23DCDxZhVZGHyUWvz8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# R1\n2\tFor each independent job, report what evidence/result actually exists in the supplied history, whether its relied-on predicate remains established on the current basis, and the next supported continuation. Preserve unaffected evidence and missing obligations. Do not create candidate, review, acceptance or publication facts not supplied.\n3\t\n4\t# Actual interrupted-effect task\n5\t# R1\n6\tThe request increment-once requires exactly one publication changing effects/counter.txt from 0 newline to 1 newline. The caller did not receive its acknowledgment. Recover the actual effect standing before any repeat. Finish only outstanding work under this same intent, preserve the sentinel, and record evidence in outputs/recovery.md. A second publication is a duplicate even if it writes the same bytes.\n7\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7ce3ab68-469f-4abe-8b90-21fe88ec11dc","uuid":"7db04797-1c7d-4013-af66-4c34d72e19db","timestamp":"2026-10-25T03:33:30.857Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/stdo-skills-claude-recovery-95upc9_0/workspace/specification/REQUIREMENT.md","content":"# R1\nFor each independent job, report what evidence/result actually exists in the supplied history, whether its relied-on predicate remains established on the current basis, and the next supported continuation. Preserve unaffected evidence and missing obligations. Do not create candidate, review, acceptance or publication facts not supplied.\n\n# Actual interrupted-effect task\n# R1\nThe request increment-once requires exactly one publication changing effects/counter.txt from 0 newline to 1 newline. The caller did not receive its acknowledgment. Recover the actual effect standing before any repeat. Finish only outstanding work under this same intent, preserve the sentinel, and record evidence in outputs/recovery.md. A